v1.1.1 — 2026-11-25
--------------------
- Improved forecast error handling: catches errors with proper `err` binding and displays descriptive error messages instead of generic placeholders.
- Added styling for the forecast retry button on error state.

v1.1.0 — 2026-11-24
--------------------
- Mobile-only UI/UX redesign (`<= 639px`; desktop layout unchanged):
  - Fixed bottom navigation bar with Home, Charts, Records, Wear, and weather-mast Station icons in thumb-friendly reach.
  - Compact single-row mobile header with an instant sun/moon light/dark toggle icon.
  - Active Weather Alerts default to a compact 1-line pill on mobile (tap to expand) so current conditions stay above the fold.
  - Larger 3-tier mobile typography scale (`4.35rem` hero temp, `1.42rem` bold metric values, `>= 13px` labels) and spacious 2x2 modular metric cards.
  - Hides redundant quick-jump footer row and `Lightning: Clear` pill on small screens while keeping active strike badges visible.

v1.0.0 — 2026-11-23
--------------------
- Initial public release of the Frostline skin for WeeWX v5.
- Responsive dark/light dashboard (`Auto`, `Dark`, and `Light`) with FOUC-free theme switching.
- Multi-page layout: Dashboard (`index.html`), interactive Chart.js v4 + offline Canvas fallback Charts (`charts.html`), All-Time/Year/Month/Today Records (`records.html`), What to Wear (`wear.html` with optional Running Kit and SAR 12-hour callout cards), and multi-sensor Station diagnostics (`station.html`).
- International units support (`rain_units`, `tide_units`, `aqi_standard`), US NWS & Environment Canada Weather Alerts, Open-Meteo Hourly/7-Day forecasts & Air Quality, Windy radar embed, and DFO IWLS / NOAA CO-OPS / lunar harmonic tide predictions.
- Packaged as a WeeWX v5 extension (`install.py`) defaulting `HTML_ROOT` to `public_html/frostline`.
